<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  The factory's launchd timer. `factory tick --once` runs in a fresh process every 60 s,
  which is the whole crash-safety design (§4.2): the tick that asks is never the tick that
  started the run, so every fact it acts on is read from SQLite or the filesystem at the
  top of the pass. The daemon is stateless between ticks, so `launchctl bootout` stops it
  safely at any instant and in-flight leases expire on their own.

  Load:   launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) ops/com.jchen.factory.plist
  Kick:   launchctl kickstart -k gui/$(id -u)/com.jchen.factory
  Stop:   launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u)/com.jchen.factory

  James decides when this is loaded (§19 approval boundary). Until then every run is
  manual via `factory run`, and `factory daemon` is the no-launchd foreground loop.

  The absolute `/opt/homebrew/bin/uv` path is deliberate: launchd does not inherit the
  user's PATH, so a bare `uv` or `factory` would not resolve. `uv run --project` syncs the
  environment and exposes the `factory` console script declared in pyproject.toml.

  EnvironmentVariables/PATH is the same problem one layer down, and it is the reason the
  first real load of this timer could not complete a single tick. launchd's default is
  `/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin`, which covers `git` and `security` but not the five
  other binaries the factory execs by bare name: `gh` and `sbx` in /opt/homebrew/bin,
  `codex`, `node` and `pnpm` in ~/.local/bin. Fixing only `uv` above got the process
  started and then died in `_open_pr_heads` with `FileNotFoundError: 'gh'` — and a missing
  binary raises past `_work_on`'s caught set, so it kills the whole pass, not one run.
  Keep this list in step with the adapters; `factory doctor` resolves the same names.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>com.jchen.factory</string>

    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin/uv</string>
        <string>run</string>
        <string>--project</string>
        <string>/Users/james/factory</string>
        <string>factory</string>
        <string>tick</string>
        <string>--once</string>
    </array>

    <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
    <dict>
        <key>PATH</key>
        <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/Users/james/.local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    </dict>

    <key>StartInterval</key>
    <integer>60</integer>

    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>

    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/Users/james/factory/logs/daemon.out.log</string>

    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/Users/james/factory/logs/daemon.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>